<title>SINGAPORE: Thailand tenders to buy 10,000T March 3-7 fuel oil.</title>
<headline>Thailand tenders to buy 10,000T March 3-7 fuel oil.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Petroleum Authority of Thailand (PTT) has issued a tender to buy 10,000 tonnes of 1.0 percent sulphur grade fuel oil for delivery March 3-7, industry sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes February 12 and is valid for one day.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
